Well, it's right here because I can see it.

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:09.000
But where are my keys?

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:10.000
I don't know.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:11.000
Where are my dogs?

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:12.000
I don't know.

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:13.000
What am I doing after this?

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:14.000
I have no idea.

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:15.000
I'm with you right now.

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:16.000
Most people live in the past.

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:19.000
Most people are thinking about what could have been.

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:21.000
Most people are regretting the decisions that they made,

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:22.000
and they're procrastinating

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:24.000
because they're afraid of doing things,

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:26.000
because they don't want to do things.

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:30.000
All things that prevent you from actually doing,

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.000
that's the biggest problem.

00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:33.000
You're a genius.

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:35.000
You're the best in the world at something.

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:37.000
You can't go off and make amazing things.

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:39.000
The problem is your time is not being used efficiently.

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:41.000
It's not being used effectively either.

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:43.000
You haven't structured your life

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:44.000
to help you accomplish your goals.

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:46.000
Look at your big goals.

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:48.000
What's the next big goal that you have for yourself?

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:49.000
You may not have one.

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:50.000
If you don't have one,

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:52.000
then you got to figure out what your purpose is

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:54.000
because that's the greatest thing of all time, right?

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:55.000
Get the book, build the serve.

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:56.000
You'll figure it out.

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:58.000
You'll be ignited.

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:02.000
But your next big goal, now look at your calendar.

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:05.000
Are you aligning what's in your calendar,

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:06.000
your daily habits,

00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:08.000
towards you accomplishing your goals?

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:09.000
For most people, it's no.

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:12.000
Or you have it listed, but you're not doing it

00:23:12.000 --> 00:23:14.000
because you look at it and you get afraid

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:15.000
and you procrastinate on it.

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:18.000
So trying to cut that down to almost zero,

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:19.000
even before making these videos.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:20.000
Before making these videos,

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:23.000
I have a couple minutes of procrastination.

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:25.000
I go and make sure I get my water.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:28.000
I go and maybe have a keto bar.

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:30.000
I just pace it around a little bit

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.000
because I'm nervous about making the videos

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:34.000
because I want them to be the best videos that I've ever made.

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:35.000
It's always my intention.

00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:39.000
But too many people live in hours or days

00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:41.000
or months of procrastination

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:42.000
instead of doing it.

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:43.000
You get the results by doing.

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:44.000
It's the only way.

00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:47.000
You will never get the results by just thinking about it.

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:49.000
You can be motivated, amazing.

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:50.000
You can have the mindset, awesome.

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:51.000
That's half the equation.

00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:52.000
The other half is doing.

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:54.000
You have to actually just go out there and do.

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:56.000
You need to structure your life

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:58.000
to allow you to accomplish your goals.

00:23:58.000 --> 00:24:00.000
I'm going to give you a three-step process that will help.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:03.000
Step number one is start with the mission and work backwards.

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:04.000
So the mission is lifetime.

00:24:04.000 --> 00:24:05.000
The mission is lifetime,

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:08.000
not what specifically you're going to be doing,

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:09.000
but your purpose comes from your pain.

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:11.000
We've talked about that a lot on this channel.

00:24:11.000 --> 00:24:13.000
I love helping entrepreneurs

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:14.000
because I struggled so much as an entrepreneur.

00:24:14.000 --> 00:24:17.000
Whoever you used to be, where you struggled

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:18.000
and felt the most worthless,

00:24:18.000 --> 00:24:20.000
you will love helping those people for the rest of your life.

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:21.000
That will never get old.

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:23.000
How you do it will change a lot.

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:25.000
Right now I'm doing it through YouTube videos,

00:24:25.000 --> 00:24:26.000
I'm doing it through books,

00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:28.000
I'm doing it through my tours, all of that.

00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:29.000
But it's going to change.

00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:30.000
In 10 years it will be different.

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:31.000
Maybe YouTube's not around.

00:24:31.000 --> 00:24:33.000
Maybe people don't have paper books anymore.

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:35.000
There's going to be lots of changes that come.

00:24:35.000 --> 00:24:38.000
But that mission, that purpose will never change.

00:24:38.000 --> 00:24:39.000
It will never change.

00:24:39.000 --> 00:24:41.000
And when you figure out what it is for you,

00:24:41.000 --> 00:24:42.000
it will never change as well.

00:24:42.000 --> 00:24:43.000
So start with your mission

00:24:43.000 --> 00:24:45.000
and then you start working backwards.

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:47.000
Set number two is understand that your success is habits.

00:24:47.000 --> 00:24:49.000
Your success is habits.

00:24:49.000 --> 00:24:51.000
What you do on a regular basis

00:24:51.000 --> 00:24:53.000
is what you're going to accomplish.

00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:55.000
You can eat a chocolate bar and be on a diet and not get fat.

00:24:55.000 --> 00:24:57.000
But if you eat in a chocolate bar every day,

00:24:57.000 --> 00:24:58.000
you're going to get fat.

00:24:58.000 --> 00:24:59.000
You're not on a diet anymore.

00:24:59.000 --> 00:25:01.000
Similarly, if you eat salad once a week,

00:25:01.000 --> 00:25:03.000
it's not enough, right?

00:25:03.000 --> 00:25:04.000
You are what you consistently do.

00:25:04.000 --> 00:25:06.000
Your success comes from doing habits

00:25:06.000 --> 00:25:09.000
and entrepreneurs are typically great starters

00:25:09.000 --> 00:25:11.000
but not great at being consistent.

00:25:11.000 --> 00:25:12.000
And that's the problem.

00:25:12.000 --> 00:25:15.000
Working your face off for a 48-hour stretch

00:25:15.000 --> 00:25:17.000
isn't going to do anything for you.

00:25:17.000 --> 00:25:19.000
It's every single day working,

00:25:19.000 --> 00:25:21.000
even if it's only an hour a day.

00:25:21.000 --> 00:25:22.000
That dream that you have,

00:25:22.000 --> 00:25:24.000
that business that you want to start,

00:25:24.000 --> 00:25:26.000
that business that you want to take to the next level,

00:25:26.000 --> 00:25:27.000
it could be there.

00:25:27.000 --> 00:25:29.000
It could have been there already.

00:25:29.000 --> 00:25:31.000
The problem is you've been sitting on that idea

00:25:31.000 --> 00:25:32.000
for three months, six months, four years

00:25:32.000 --> 00:25:34.000
without doing enough on it.

00:25:34.000 --> 00:25:35.000
Little tiny starts.

00:25:35.000 --> 00:25:36.000
Little tiny starts, it's not enough.

00:25:36.000 --> 00:25:38.000
Every day, I'm talking every single day,

00:25:38.000 --> 00:25:41.000
making progress towards you actually accomplishing that thing.

00:25:41.000 --> 00:25:42.000
You want that life?

00:25:42.000 --> 00:25:43.000
You have to do it every day.

00:25:43.000 --> 00:25:46.000
And step number three is no 10-year goals.

