00:26:48.000 --> 00:26:51.000
The idea, think of who you were three years ago, right?

00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:53.000
Let alone five years ago or 10 years ago.

00:26:53.000 --> 00:26:54.000
Just take three years ago.

00:26:54.000 --> 00:26:57.000
Who you were three years ago,

00:26:57.000 --> 00:27:00.000
could you accurately predict where you are right now?

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:02.000
There's no way, not if you're growing.

00:27:02.000 --> 00:27:03.000
Like Jordan said,

00:27:03.000 --> 00:27:05.000
he starts off saying three-year plan

00:27:05.000 --> 00:27:06.000
